# SQL sites allowed outside storage/, graph/, link/ and model/: `path count  # reason`.
# Checked by `python3 scripts/sql-sites.py --check scripts/sql-sites.allow`; a count may only
# go down, and a lowered count must lower its line here.
embedding/cache.rs 20  # its own database file and schema, not the index
cli/embed_eval.rs 7  # reads snapshot copies whose schema may predate the current one
